WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:10.440
Teikoku Academy tempers their skills with a strict training regime.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.490
There's no chance that Raimon can win with only ten players.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.530
Let's hope so.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:21.530
But on the off-chance that Raimon <i>does</i>  win and Teikoku is defeated,

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:25.360
you will have to give up on the money for your brother's surgery.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:32.030
Emperor Penguin 7!

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.390
Burning Catch!

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:05.240
The long rivalry between Raimon Jr. High and Teikoku Academy!

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:09.320
The score is 1-0, with Raimon lagging behind!

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.140
Raimon is on the counterattack!

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.140
Kurama approaches as he dribbles!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.160
Sargasso!

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:10.250
Britannia Cross!

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:22.870
But Teikoku's attack doesn't yield even with their score lead!

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:27.080
Are the consequences of lacking a field player starting to take their toll?

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:32.520
Your teammates need you...

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:35.270
So what're you doing <i>here</i> ?

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.910
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:52.380
Dragoon Tedis!

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.510
Your Avatar's no match for us!

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:10.520
Coach Kidou and Trainer Sakuma have perfect command over the team!

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:14.120
How will Raimon's Coach Endou handle the plays from here?

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:20.190
We need Ultimate Thunder to change the game around!

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:24.450
I'll make it in this time!

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.180
Dash Train!

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.460
Shindou!

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:41.240
Let's do it!

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:44.730
Hayami!

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.090
Kirino-kun!

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:47.300
Amagi-san!

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.180
Kurama!

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:54.850
Ultimate Thunder!

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:03.320
Kurama's kick power just isn't enough...

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:06.610
Raimon makes another incomplete attack!

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:14.400
Is that all soccer means to you?

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:17.170
Answer me, Kyousuke.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.070
It doesn't matter how much you struggle!

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:28.030
Teikoku will be the one to win!

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:36.670
Black Wings Raven!

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:39.480
This guy's an Avatar user too!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:53.970
Burning Catch!

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:04.440
Goal!

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:05.260
The second score!

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:10.900
This'll put an end to Raimon for sure.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:15.720
I heard you talking to that man.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:24.110
Kyousuke, did I ask you?

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:28.200
Did I ever ask you to fix my legs? Even once?!

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:34.170
The organization that sets the outcomes for soccer matches, Fifth Sector...

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:37.770
I can't believe you were involved with guys like that.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:41.360
Is that what you think of the soccer we love?

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:44.800
It's fun when you're winning. It hurts to lose.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:48.010
You want to pass people when you're dribbling. You want to make the goal.

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:52.930
Each one of those feelings lights a fire deep in your chest.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.510
Isn't that what soccer is, Kyousuke?!

00:06:59.030 --> 00:06:59.890
Nii-san...

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.430
You've betrayed soccer.

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:06.360
You've betrayed the soccer that we loved!

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:07.530
Get out!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.410
We're behind by two points.

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:31.560
We can't let the difference spread out any further!

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:33.490
I'll take care of this guy!

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:38.020
The most effective way to defend against an Avatar is with another Avatar.

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:40.280
It's written all over your face!

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:52.780
Teikoku makes a fierce attack!

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:56.260
Raimon makes a narrow block with sacrificial plays!

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:01.540
The first half finally ends!

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:04.800
Teikoku is strong...

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:07.830
Is there really no way to go against Fifth Sector?

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:09.630
Shindou...

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:13.260
I quit the soccer club.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:15.140
I shouldn't be thinking about being there with them now...

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:18.470
They're easy pickings.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:22.240
I don't see how the other teams had trouble with these guys.

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:23.820
Mercy is our greatest enemy.

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:26.010
Lions will use their full strength to hunt even rabbits.

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:29.100
What's wrong, Endou?

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:31.510
Is that all there is to Raimon's power?

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:36.710
At least we made it out with a 2-point difference so far.

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:39.460
But at this rate, we won't win.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:42.610
If only we could get Ultimate Thunder to work...

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:51.160
Kurama-senpai, let's try it again.

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:54.400
Tenma...

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.920
If we don't try, we won't get anywhere.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:58.750
Please.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:03.460
How are we supposed to get it to work when it hasn't with everything we've tried?!

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:04.420
Don't give up.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:08.930
There are things only those who don't give up can obtain.

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:15.100
But what should we do...

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:17.700
Put me on!

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:21.700
Tsurugi!

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:25.120
Let me play in the match.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:28.650
You aren't running off this time?

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:29.920
Not as a Seed...

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:33.120
As a soccer player, I'm asking you to let me on! Please!

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:34.520
Tsurugi...

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:37.470
How can we trust <i>you</i> ?

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:47.570
Coach Endou...

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.020
It's your decision, guys.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.980
I believe in Tsurugi.

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:56.990
Tenma!

00:09:57.440 --> 00:10:00.560
Tsurugi's the one who's been giving us a hard time all this time.

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:05.770
I thought I could trust you a bit in the previous match, but you didn't even come to practice after that.

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:08.190
And now you're late to this match.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.400
And you still trust him?!

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:11.760
I do.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:14.720
Remember Tsurugi's plays.

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:19.960
You can't make amazing plays like that if you didn't like soccer.

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:23.260
That's why I believe in him.

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:29.660
I believe in him too.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:30.600
Captain!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:31.060
Yeah!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:36.460
Fine then.

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:38.090
We're missing a player anyway.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:38.950
Senpai!

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:41.990
Tsurugi, you're on.

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:43.100
Yes, sir.

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:45.030
Let's do our best, Tsurugi!

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:53.120
The score was 2-0 at the end of the first half, with Teikoku in the lead!

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:55.500
And here, Tsurugi makes his appearance!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.090
Raimon finally has eleven on the field!

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:05.130
Perhaps he's resolved to do what's needed to secure the funds for his brother's surgery.

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:10.660
Kyousuke.

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:12.520
You should travel down your own path.

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:15.980
Then I'll be able to share the same dream as you.

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:20.040
It's more than obvious that Teikoku will be the victor here.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:23.210
There's nothing left for him to do at this point.

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:26.950
I'm sure Tsurugi will change the flow of the game.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.180
The second half starts!

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:37.400
Which team will get to proceed to the Holy Road's Kanto block district prelim finals? Teikoku or Raimon?

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:41.890
Inazuma Eleven...

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:42.720
GO!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.290
Inazuma Eleven...

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.270
GO!

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:53.440
With Teikoku's kickoff, the second half starts!

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:56.020
What?

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:00.400
Tsurugi steals the ball right off the whistle!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.650
It's clear to me now.

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:05.160
Tsurugi has completely double-crossed Fifth Sector!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.820
What a fool.

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:11.770
But his deference to Raimon isn't going to change the outcome.

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:14.180
Teikoku will be the ones to win...

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:15.330
No, Fifth Sector!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:18.190
Kurama, make the finishing shoot!

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:19.320
Got it.

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:21.840
Tsurugi, you know how it goes, right?

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:22.840
Yeah!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.130
Let's go!

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:30.180
Hayami!

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:31.350
Kirino-kun!

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:32.770
Amagi-san!

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:36.640
Tsurugi!

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:39.520
Ultimate Thunder!

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:48.310
I'll make it in for my brother!

00:12:50.650 --> 00:12:51.510
He did it!

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:52.450
He kicked it...

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:54.360
His kick can do it!

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:02.630
Looks like there wasn't any point in adding Tsurugi.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:11.050
Ultimate Thunder is a hissatsu tactics that sends a shockwave in the enemy camp from the force of the ball's impact.

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:14.290
Why didn't it work?

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:16.260
We have the kick power to do it now...

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:18.740
Tsurugi.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.720
One more time.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:21.830
I'll make it in this time!

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:27.410
Here it comes!

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:32.700
Ultimate Thunder!

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:37.540
How about this one?!

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:45.550
Again...

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:47.260
Why?

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:51.930
Kyousuke.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.430
Hey now, what's going on?

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:57.370
He's not holding back, is he?

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:58.350
But...!

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.150
Tsurugi.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:04.630
Is he slipping up on purpose so Raimon ends up losing?

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:09.870
He doesn't even need to bother. We'll beat you guys either way.

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:13.940
No. I'm serious.

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:15.890
I'm playing for real...

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:19.880
<i>If Raimon  </i>does<i> win,</i>

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:24.090
<i>you will have to give up on the money for your brother's surgery.</i>

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.240
Kyousuke.

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:31.010
Once you're on the field, don't think about anything except soccer.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:36.980
You wouldn't want to be the reason why your brother can't get his surgery, right?

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:41.610
The Mist!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.290
Awesome!

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:54.950
So that's Kirino-senpai's defense technique?

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:55.700
Tsurugi!

00:14:58.450 --> 00:14:59.160
Tsurugi!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.290
Lost the will to fight?

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.500
What's wrong, Tsurugi?!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.960
You're not looking soccer straight in the eye as you are now!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:16.140
And that's...

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:17.820
That's...

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:20.560
That's making soccer cry!

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:37.330
Tsurugi!

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:39.810
Shindou!

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:42.560
Let's go, everyone!

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:48.000
I won't turn my back on my brother's tears any longer!

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:49.470
There!

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:54.060
If there's any way for me to make up for my brother's loss...

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:57.660
That would be...

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:02.350
To play the soccer my brother and I share in his stead!

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.010
Hayami!

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:05.190
Kirino-kun!

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:07.610
Amagi-san!

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:08.400
Here it comes!

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:11.510
Ultimate Thunder!

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:14.280
Take this!

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:24.560
So this is Ultimate Thunder!

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:25.510
Awesome!

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:26.330
Tsurugi!

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:30.050
Raimon finally breaks apart Teikoku's defense!

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:35.840
Mach Wind!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.080
Power Spike!

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:47.930
I did it!

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.910
Goal!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:53.410
Matsukaze's first official goal brings Raimon one point closer!

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:55.570
At 2-1, there's only a 1-point difference!

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:57.530
That was amazing, Tenma!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:58.490
You did it!

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:03.290
Tenma!

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:06.920
Presto Turn!

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.300
Surfing Pierrot!

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:22.120
I can feel it!

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:24.740
That goal wasn't just any goal!

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:27.690
It was a goal we all got by working together!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.310
We're going for the win, guys!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.020
Yeah!

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:31.760
That's right.

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:33.280
Play your soccer, the way you like it.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.320
These guys aren't moving like they were before!

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:37.570
I'll stop them!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.280
Black Wings Raven!

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:56.790
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:03.010
You did it, Captain!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:05.560
Shindou blows past Mikado!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:06.600
Tsurugi!

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:09.480
I'm not letting you score!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:12.980
Tsurugi kicks it high up!

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:17.450
I'll jump higher than anyone else!

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:21.620
Full Throttle Jump!

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:28.660
What?!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.720
Power Spike!

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:38.150
Goal!

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:39.740
I did it?

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:42.280
I scored...

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:47.060
Nishizono Shinsuke's first goal brings the score to a heavy tie!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.400
You did it!

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:50.230
You did it, Shinsuke!

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:52.110
You finally got one!

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:53.300
Yes!

00:18:57.080 --> 00:19:02.320
It seems they aren't aware of what the consequences will be for these actions.

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:05.240
We can't afford to lose any more points.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.920
We'll use all the Seeds to defend!

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.920
Everyone in Teikoku heads back to their side of the field!

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:15.310
Sakuma.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:16.130
Yes, sir.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:17.880
Let's go, guys!

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:20.000
We'll win!

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:20.800
And our...

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:21.750
Soccer...

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:23.040
We'll protect it!

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:23.710
No matter what...

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.300
We'll win!

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:27.130
Hayami!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:28.560
Kirino-kun!

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:30.380
Amagi-san!

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:31.530
Here it comes!

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:35.610
Ultimate Thunder!

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:43.070
It's even stronger than before!

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:47.030
It's powered up now that the team is acting as one!

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:51.540
We Seeds... Fifth Sector mustn't lose!

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:58.130
On the name of the Seeds, we won't let you score!

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:00.790
Dragoon Tedis!

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:02.930
Soyokaze Step!

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:09.210
I won't let you shoot!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:10.500
Matsukaze!

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:14.740
He was already that far up?!

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:21.540
Death Drop!

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:27.770
Power Spike!

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:33.320
Goal!

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:35.090
Raimon finally turns the score around!

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:39.880
With Matsukaze's assist, Tsurugi Kyousuke makes the score to bring them into the lead!

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:44.540
There's the end of the game!

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:45.620
Yes!

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:50.120
The ones to continue onto the Holy Road's Kanto block district prelim finals is Raimon!

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:57.100
Nii-san.

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:05.580
Matsukaze and Nishizono's first official goals, and Tsurugi's winning goal!

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:08.650
Believe it or not, Raimon's goals were all from first-years!

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:12.060
And Tsurugi's involvement has been a huge part of Raimon's success!

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:14.980
They've splendidly guided the team to victory!

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:19.710
So you've broken past Teikoku, Endou.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:23.040
Kidou, why are you with Fifth Sector?

00:22:54.110 --> 00:22:57.010
A new destiny awaits the Raimon Eleven.

00:22:57.010 --> 00:23:00.640
And I get to drop by Coach Endou's home!

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:04.070
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Stir Up A Revolutionary Wind!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:05.860
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.180 --> 00:23:17.910
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.450 --> 00:23:26.040
There are things only those who don't give up can obtain.

